h1 Welcome, #{USERNAME}
p Your account has been created. You can now connect apps and devices, review what you share, and manage your data.
p The email address registered on this account is #[strong #{EMAIL}].
if VERIFY_LINK
  p
    | Please confirm that this address belongs to you, so that the applications you use can rely on it:
  p
    a(href=VERIFY_LINK target="_blank" rel="noopener") Verify my email address
  p The link expires after a while; if it has, request a new one from your account page.
p If you did not create this account, please contact the operator of this service.
